@startuml match-modules
' Feature modules inside Match.
' ArchUnit: PlantUmlArchitectureTest in services/match.
' security <-> conversation is a cycle, so security is not on this diagram.

title Match feature modules
skinparam componentStyle rectangle

[match] <<com.tinder.match.match..>>
[conversation] <<com.tinder.match.conversation..>>
[moderation] <<com.tinder.match.moderation..>>

conversation --> moderation

note bottom
  No arrow match <-> conversation: a match record
  must not import chat, and chat must not import
  the match aggregate.
  security talks both ways with conversation —
  that stays out of this file.
end note

@enduml
